title: "Galley"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bodkhe
    given-names: Rahul
repository-code: "https://github.com/rahulnccs/galley-check"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22733230
license: MIT
version: 1.5.0
abstract: >-
  An offline desktop tool for life-science researchers. It checks manuscript
  drafts for figure, table, citation, reference, abbreviation, species-name,
  consistency and ethics-statement problems, and matches researchers to
  fellowships and travel grants, tracks their applications and checks
  application documents against funders' formats, without uploading anything.
